### Get all restaurants projections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### Get a restaurant with its details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants/03080bb4-f5c9-464e-bf00-217d045af233
Accept: application/json

### Filter restaurants by cuisine and price
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants/filter?cuisine=Italian&priceRange=Regular
Accept: application/json

### Filter dishes with tags and type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/dishes/03080bb4-f5c9-464e-bf00-217d045af233/filter?type=&tags=gluten
Accept: application/json

### Get vegan desserts sorted by name descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/dishes/03080bb4-f5c9-464e-bf00-217d045af233/filter?type=entree&tags=&sortBy=name&direction=desc
Accept: application/json